---
---
<section id="modo-pareja" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto scroll-mt-24 relative">
  <!-- Glowing ambient orb for this section -->
  <div class="absolute -top-16 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[500px] h-[350px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#DF7591]/20 via-[#70163C]/15 to-[#E8A598]/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <!-- Section Header -->
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FCE8EE] border border-[#DF7591]/40 text-[#70163C] text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 shadow-2xs">
      <span class="text-base">💕</span>
      <span>Nueva Experiencia Glassmorphism Premium</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-[#2D141E] leading-tight mb-4">
      Modo Pareja: Conexión, Empatía y Cuidado en Tiempo Real
    </h2>
    <p class="text-[#7A5C68] font-medium text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Comparte cómo te sientes hoy mediante un enlace web privado y visualmente deslumbrante. Tu pareja sabrá exactamente en qué fase estás, tu nivel de energía y cómo consentirte con amor, ¡sin necesidad de que instale nada!
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive Grid: Glassmorphism Visualizer Demo & Feature Breakdown -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center mb-16">
    
    <!-- Left Column: Feature Highlights (5 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
      
      <!-- Feature 1: Fase & Progreso -->
      <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#DF7591]/30 hover:border-[#70163C]/40 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FCE8EE] text-[#70163C] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            🌙
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-[#2D141E] mb-1">Fase Actual y Progreso del Ciclo</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#7A5C68] leading-relaxed">
              Muestra con precisión matemática si te encuentras en fase <strong>Menstrual, Folicular, Ovulatoria o Lútea</strong>, la barra de progreso de los días y la fertilidad actual.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Estado de Ánimo y Síntomas -->
      <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#DF7591]/30 hover:border-[#70163C]/40 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FCE8EE] text-[#70163C] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            💭
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-[#2D141E] mb-1">Estado de Ánimo y Nivel de Energía</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#7A5C68] leading-relaxed">
              Insignias interactivas que comunican cómo estás: si te sientes amorosa, sensible, cansada o con antojos, indicando tu nivel de energía física y anímica.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Guía "Cómo consentirla hoy" -->
      <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#DF7591]/30 hover:border-[#70163C]/40 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FCE8EE] text-[#70163C] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            💡
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-[#2D141E] mb-1">Guía "Cómo consentirla hoy"</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#7A5C68] leading-relaxed">
              Consejos prácticos, afectivos y empáticos elaborados según la fase del ciclo: qué decirle, qué detalles le alegrarán el día y cómo brindarle paz y comprensión.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4: Privacidad en la App -->
      <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#DF7591]/30 hover:border-[#70163C]/40 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FCE8EE] text-[#70163C] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            🔒
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-[#2D141E] mb-1">Selector de Privacidad Total</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#7A5C68] leading-relaxed">
              Desde la app (<code class="text-xs text-[#70163C] font-semibold">partner_mode_screen</code>) tú decides exactamente qué compartir: fase, síntomas, notas privadas o deseos.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Interactive Glassmorphic Live Card Preview (7 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="w-full max-w-lg bg-gradient-to-b from-white/95 to-[#FFF7F9]/90 rounded-[36px] p-6 sm:p-8 border-2 border-[#DF7591]/35 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl">
        
        <!-- Ambient lighting glow inside card -->
        <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-44 h-44 bg-[#DF7591]/30 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-44 h-44 bg-[#70163C]/20 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <!-- Header inside preview -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-5 border-b border-[#DF7591]/20 mb-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <img src="/logo.png" alt="Logo" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl object-contain shadow-xs bg-white p-0.5 border border-[#DF7591]/30" />
            <div>
              <span class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-[#70163C] block leading-tight">Luna & Brillo</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-[#7A5C68] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Modo Pareja • En Vivo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#FCE8EE] text-[11px] font-bold text-[#70163C] border border-[#DF7591]/30">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#DF7591] animate-ping"></span>
            Sincronizado
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Hero Status Card (Burgundy Glassmorphism) -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#70163C] via-[#A22C58] to-[#DF7591] text-white p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden mb-6">
          <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-36 h-36 bg-white/15 rounded-full blur-xl pointer-events-none"></div>
          
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/80 block">Estado de tu pareja</span>
              <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-white">Camila 💕</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-xs font-bold border border-white/30">
              <span>🌾</span>
              <span>Fase Lútea</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Progress Bar -->
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/20">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-white/90 mb-1.5">
              <span>Día 22 de 28 del ciclo</span>
              <span>78%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-2.5 bg-black/20 rounded-full overflow-hidden p-0.5">
              <div class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-[#FCE8EE] rounded-full w-[78%] transition-all duration-1000"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ¿Cómo se siente hoy? Interactive Mood Badges -->
        <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-[#DF7591]/25 mb-4 shadow-2xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-base">💭</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#70163C]">¿Cómo me siento hoy?</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#FCE8EE] text-[#70163C] border border-[#DF7591]/30">
              🥰 Amorosa
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#FCE8EE] text-[#70163C] border border-[#DF7591]/30">
              🥺 Sensible
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#FCE8EE] text-[#70163C] border border-[#DF7591]/30">
              🍫 Con antojos
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#FCE8EE] text-[#70163C] border border-[#DF7591]/30">
              😴 Cansada
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs pt-2 border-t border-[#DF7591]/15">
            <span class="text-[#7A5C68] font-medium">Nivel de energía física:</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-[#70163C] bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-amber-200">
              ⚡ Baja (Necesita descanso)
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Guía de oro para cuidarla hoy -->
        <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-[#DF7591]/25 mb-5 shadow-2xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-base">💡</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#70163C]">Cómo consentirla hoy:</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#2D141E] leading-relaxed mb-3">
            "Su cuerpo se prepara para renovarse. Tenle mucha paciencia, dale un abrazo largo y mímala con su comida o postre favorito."
          </p>
          <div class="bg-[#FFF0F4] p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#DF7591]/30 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-xl">🎁</span>
            <div class="text-xs">
              <span class="font-bold text-[#70163C] block">Detalle recomendado:</span>
              <span class="text-[#7A5C68]">Chocolate oscuro, masajes en la espalda y cero estrés.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Links inside preview -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a 
            href="/pareja.html" 
            target="_blank"
            class="flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#70163C] to-[#8E2150] hover:from-[#8E2150] hover:to-[#70163C] text-white py-3.5 px-4 rounded-2xl font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all hover:scale-102 flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Abrir Modo Pareja Completo</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <button 
            onclick="alert('¡Excelente! Este enlace abrirá WhatsApp con una respuesta amorosa lista para enviar 💕')"
            class="bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#20ba5a] text-white py-3.5 px-4 rounded-2xl font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-sm transition-all hover:scale-102 flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.582 2.128 2.182-.573c.976.532 1.943.924 3.15.924 3.182 0 5.767-2.587 5.767-5.766.001-3.187-2.575-5.766-5.768-5.766zm9.969 5.766c0 5.514-4.485 9.999-10 9.999-1.758 0-3.4-.455-4.834-1.249l-5.166 1.312 1.354-4.945c-.887-1.488-1.354-3.197-1.354-5.117 0-5.514 4.486-10 10-10 5.515 0 10 4.486 10 10z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Responder por WhatsApp</span>
          </button>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- WhatsApp Open Graph Preview Simulation Banner -->
  <div class="glass-card p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[32px] border border-[#DF7591]/30 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
    <div class="space-y-2 max-w-xl text-center md:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#FCE8EE] text-[10px] text-[#70163C] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>📲 Previsualización Inteligente</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#2D141E]">
        Tarjetas con Metadatos Open Graph para WhatsApp
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#7A5C68] leading-relaxed">
        Al compartir el enlace desde la app en WhatsApp o Telegram, se genera automáticamente una tarjeta enriquecida con el logotipo oficial (<code class="text-[#70163C] font-bold">logo.png</code>), título elegante y resumen emocional.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- WhatsApp Bubble Simulated Card -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-xs bg-[#E7F8E8] rounded-2xl p-3 border border-[#25D366]/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-2">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#70163C] to-[#DF7591] p-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/logo.png" alt="Logo" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white p-0.5 object-contain shadow-xs" />
          <div class="text-white">
            <span class="block text-xs font-bold leading-tight">Luna & Brillo 💕 — Modo Pareja</span>
            <span class="block text-[9px] opacity-80">luna-y-brillo.web.app/pareja.html</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-2.5 text-[11px] text-[#2D141E]">
          <p class="font-bold">Mira cómo me siento hoy y cómo puedes consentirme ✨</p>
          <p class="text-[9px] text-[#7A5C68] mt-0.5">Fase actual, nivel de energía y detalles para alegrarme el día.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="text-[9px] text-stone-500 font-semibold self-end">12:45 p. m. ✓✓</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
